  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is",
